      "trackName": "Dope Wars on Watch",
      "description": "The classic turn-based strategy gameplay is reborn with Dope Wars on Watch—a modern Apple Watch adaptation of the iconic DOS game. Navigate a high-stakes world of fast-paced trading, risky loans, and unpredictable market events. Buy low, sell high, and fend off rivals (and persistent law enforcement) to achieve a high score.\n\n# Features: \n- Classic Turn-Based Gameplay: Manage resources, dodge hazards, and grow your empire—all from your wrist.\n-  Dynamic Markets: Prices shift daily. Adapt to events, insider tips, and surprise challenges. \n- Risk vs. Reward: Borrow cash (carefully!), deposit earned cash, and upgrade your toolkit to stay ahead. \n- Watch-Optimized: Quick sessions, intuitive controls, and glanceable stats for on-the-go play. \n- Challenge: Unlock different game endings with your high score.\n\nDisclaimer: Dope Wars on Watch is a fictional strategy game inspired by retro classics. It does not endorse or depict real-world illegal activities. For entertainment purposes only.",
